oduce a 440→220 Hz descending two-tone chirp (any valid `.caf`); document in A's \"For next (B)\" that real assets are still needed\n714\t\n715\t2. Modify: `SunnyWalker/Services/AudioPlayer.swift`\n716\t   - Add `extension AudioPlayer: AVAudioPlayerDelegate`\n717\t   - Set `player?.delegate = self` after `player = try AVAudioPlayer(contentsOf: url)`\n718\t   - Implement `audioPlayerDidFinishPlaying(_:successfully:)`: set `isPlaying = false`\n719\t   - Acceptance: after non-looping playback ends, `isPlaying` transitions to `false` automatically; `testAudioPlayerIsPlayingAutoResets` test passes (write it)\n720\t\n721\t3. Add: App icon placeholder to `SunnyWalker/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset`\n722\t   - Add at minimum a 1024×1024 solid-color or simple watercolor-style PNG with the app initials \"SW\" or a simple sun/cloud shape\n723\t   - Register it in `Contents.json` under the `ios-marketing` idiom\n724\t   - Acceptance: `xcodebuild archive` no longer warns \"Missing App Icon\"; the icon appears on the home screen during simulator testing\n725\t\n726\t4. Modify: `SunnyWalker/Views/Home/HomeView.swift` (iPad adaptation starter)\n727\t   - Add `@Environment(\\.horizontalSizeClass) private var sizeClass`\n728\t   - In `body`: when `sizeClass == .regular`, use a side-by-side layout (`HStack`) with the clock/avatar on the left and `AlarmListView` on the right, rather than the current stacked `VStack`\n729\t   - Acceptance: running on iPad simulator shows a two-column layout; iPhone layout is unchanged\n730\t\n731\t5. Optional: Refactor `checkPendingAlarm()` to accept an injected delegate (for testability)\n732\t   - Change signature to `func checkPendingAlarm(delegate: AppDelegate? = UIApplication.shared.delegate as? AppDelegate)`\n733\t   - Add a unit test that passes a directly constructed `AppDelegate`, sets `pendingAlarmID`, calls `checkPendingAlarm(delegate:)`, and asserts `firingAlarm` is set\n734\t   - Acceptance: the `checkPendingAlarm` path has at least one